config UNISOC_REG_TRACE_MONITOR
  tristate "Unisoc Reg Trace Monitor Support"
  depends on SPRD_DEBUG
  help
	this macro is for rtm driver, rtm is a debug tool that
	is used to monitor register access for apb/apb/axi bus,
	then the data pass atb bus to coresight etf or etr. It
	can be captured by debug tools or other commands.
	Say M or Y here to support RTM, say n not.

